  "contentHtml": "<p>교내 융합과학대회를 온라인에서 치뤘습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>2020.5.29 (금) 17:00~19:00</p><p>교내STEAM융합과학대회를 ZOOM으로 치뤘습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>구글로 참가신청을 받은후 </p><p><br></p><p>5.25(월) 17:00에&nbsp;ZOOM에서 대회 오리엔테이션을&nbsp;했구요.</p><p>오리엔테이션 자료는 위두랑에 공유했습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D199%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20200614165741&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile297.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A0C14B5EE5D86A0C585D')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> STEAM융합과학대회 안내문(1).pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img width=\"677\" height=\"259\" class=\"txc-image\" id=\"tx_entry_36932_\" style=\"width: 677px; height: 259px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F5B93B5ED0CD5325\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20200529_175139.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" id=\"A_99F5B93B5ED0CD53252FDC\"/><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996C76485EE5D92B08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"458\" height=\"304\" style=\"width: 458px; height: 304px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"1111.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"770\"  id=\"A_996C76485EE5D92B08CBE7\"/><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FB2C485EE5D8110F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"447\" height=\"228\" style=\"width: 447px; height: 228px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"112.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"773\"  id=\"A_99FB2C485EE5D8110F4966\"/></p><p><br></p><p>* 4월부터 위두랑에 '운암고 창의융합부(교내외 과학대회 운영)' 방을 만들어서</p><p>각종 과학 행사, 대회에 관심있는 학생들에게 정보를 제공하는 공간을 만들었습니다.</p><p>(저희학교 학생 모두&nbsp;위두랑 플랫폼을 사용하고 있어서 공지하기 편리합니다.)</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img width=\"289\" height=\"217\" class=\"txc-image\" id=\"tx_entry_67822_\" style=\"width: 289px; height: 217px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A1524A5ED0D15918\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20200529_180809.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"366\" id=\"A_99A1524A5ED0D15918E9DB\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>대회 전날 </p><p>참가 신청 학생들에게 문자도 보냈습니다.<br></p><table width=\"401\" class=\"txc-table\" style=\"border: currentColor; border-image: none; width: 401px; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 400px; height: 342px;\"><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년 문자 내용)&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[STEAM</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">융합과학대회 안내</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장소 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">줌 회의방</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">회의</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">ID : 000)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입장시간</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 16</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">45</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부터 입장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 17</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분 부터는 입장이 불가함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입장 시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반드시 학번</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이름으로 표기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">준비물 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: A4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">용지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">필기도구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">색연필</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사인펜 등</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(2, 3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년 문자 내용)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[STEAM</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">융합과학대회 안내</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장소 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">화학실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생물실</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입실시간 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 16</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">55</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">준비물 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가림막</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">필기도구</span><sp